{"words": [{"text": "وَكَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "And thus"}, {"text": "نُفَصِّلُ", "translation": "We explain"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ", "translation": "the Verses"}, {"text": "وَلِتَسْتَبِينَ", "translation": "so that becomes manifest"}, {"text": "سَبِيلُ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ", "translation": "(of) the criminals"}], "sahih": "And thus do We detail the verses, and [thus] the way of the criminals will become evident."}